.SH "DirectX Tool Kit for DirectX 12"
.PP
http://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkID=615561
.PP
Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation\&.
.PP
\fBJune 4, 2024\fP
.PP
This package contains the 'DirectX Tool Kit', a collection of helper classes for writing Direct3D 12 C++ code for Universal Windows Platform (UWP) apps for Windows 11 and Windows 10, game titles for Xbox Series X|S and Xbox One, and Win32 desktop applications for Windows 11 and Windows 10\&.
.PP
This code is designed to build with Visual Studio 2019 (16\&.11), Visual Studio 2022, clang for Windows v12 or later, or MinGW 12\&.2\&. Use of the Windows 10 May 2020 Update SDK (\fR19041\fP) or later is required for Visual Studio\&.
.PP
These components are designed to work without requiring any content from the legacy \fBDirectX\fP SDK\&. For details, see \fRWhere is the DirectX SDK?\fP\&.
